# One line-ending policy for every checkout (Windows and Linux): LF in the repo
# and in the working tree. Do not run `git add --renormalize .` casually; it
# rewrites every file that still has CRLF and collides with open data PRs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never diff, merge or convert.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
